repro_steps: Run closeout tests with SDK 2026.11.13 and 2026.11.14.
expected_result: Named fresh assertions remain available for criterion verification.
actual_result: Commands pass but closeout reports execution_missing.
comments[6]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-17T18:30:59.098Z",codex-sol,"Job 133920462791 reports execution_missing although the linked command passed. Release 2026.11.14 documents quiet passing streams limited to 6 lines and 480 characters (pm-v1mp64); this is intended output projection, not tracker discovery or realpath failure. Request --full-output on hosts from that version, retaining older host compatibility."
  "2026-11-17T18:44:06.542Z",codex-sol,"Validation: npm run typecheck, npm run lint, build and build:test pass. The final pm-linked closeout process/round/main/review selection passes 47 tests with no skips. A disposable consumer on SDK 2026.11.13 passes the new complete-output assertion plus the four reported discovery/symlink/no-git regressions: 5 passed, 0 failed. Regenerated changelog:check passes."
  "2026-11-17T18:46:14.515Z",codex-sol,"Implementation and dependency adoption commit: d3ede6a. Final linked evidence-only selection adds 3 passes to the 47 closeout process/round/main/review passes; all 50 targeted tests pass without skips. SDK 2026.11.13 compatibility selection passes 5/5. Item remains open for orchestrator review."
  "2026-11-17T19:08:50.703Z",codex-sol,"Node 22 CI passed, while Node 26 job 134289830373 ran the suite and failed the existing 100% branch gate at 99.95%. Isolate the output-option compatibility boundary and explicitly test the supported floor, the 2026.11.13/14 migration, month rollover and year rollover. The real SDK compatibility probes already cover both sides; this supplies the missing in-process branch receipt without changing thresholds."
  "2026-11-17T19:14:59.991Z",codex-sol,"Correction to the earlier manual tally: the evidence file had 5 tests, not 3. The final five-file targeted command now reports 53 passed, 0 failed, 0 skipped. The final evidence-only pm run and Node 26 native run each pass 6 tests; all 7 instrumented ranges of fullOutputArgs execute on Node 26. The 100% branch threshold is unchanged."
  "2026-11-17T19:20:51.462Z",codex-sol,"Compatibility boundary commit: c6175e0. The final source also passes all 6 selected checks in the separate 2026.11.13 consumer. Final affected-file tests pass 53/53, evidence-only pm and Node 26 runs pass 6/6, all 7 compatibility-function ranges execute on Node 26, and typecheck/lint/build/build:test/changelog:check pass. The new CI head must certify the full suite; no coverage threshold changed."
